cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "wallet-attribution: aggregated, normalized cryptocurrency address labels"
abstract: >-
  An aggregated, normalized dataset of attributed cryptocurrency addresses
  (exchanges, sanctioned entities, hackers, ransomware, scams, mixers, mining
  pools, gambling, bridges and DeFi protocols) across 48 networks, built from
  free, public sources and stored as CSV and JSON per network.
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: prettydeath
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/prettydeath/wallet-attribution"
keywords:
  - blockchain-forensics
  - address-labels
  - attribution
  - aml
  - osint
  - cryptocurrency
